@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health/readiness
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Working list flow
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### Filtered list
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Existing details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing resource: expected 404 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json

### Invalid filter: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### T-06 Severity summary: expected 200, all severities in order Low, Medium, High, Critical (seed: 1, 1, 1, 0)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json

### T-06a Severity summary filtered by Triaged: expected 200, Medium = 1, others 0
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### T-06b Severity summary filtered by Resolved: expected 200, all counts 0
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Resolved
Accept: application/json

### T-06c Severity summary with invalid status: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Trace id correlation: trace 0af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c must appear in the API log
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json
traceparent: 00-0af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c-b7ad6b7169203331-01
